Det-C is advancing nicely, what with the +5 GoD, +4 GDSM and +1
Magicbane. What annoys me is that I've tried to keep pets and used the
poly traps in the mines to improve them. I first had a pet chameleon
in Sokoban but it went wild when I had to escape after a slight mishap
involving an un-ID'd /oPoly, a black dragon and some nice elven
mithril I'm going to have to write-off as a business expense.

