interesting resulted in a mind flayer. Nice, but as I was trying to
poly him further he attacked and was flattened by an apparently
highly-intelligent ettin. Next time I did two little dogs that turned
out as a purple worm and a gray dragon. Nice, I thought and ventured
out of the mines.

Unfortunately both pets quickly stepped into level teleport traps and
