and I had a pet arch lich. Unfortunately, just as we excited the mines
we ran into Shai-Hulud my ex-tame purple worm who promptly digested my
newly tamed arch lich. Argh!

OK, time to find another dog. After I managed to find one it turned
out to be another chameleon. OK, I can work with that. If only I
hadn't angered the minetown guards, that is. Immediately after
entering minetown one of the guards fires a /oStriking at me but
manages to hit my poor chameleon who snuffs it. Bugger.

Most annoying in the whole thing is that nowhere have I found a magic
whistle so hauling the dogs five levels down the mines using nothing
but a leach gets kind of tedious. Oh well, with the titan and his
winged gargoyles waiting patiently on Medusa I guess I'm not in a
hurry to go anywhere soon...

